#: scenario4:scenario4_7E77A93C_97B6_46DB_90A6_D4C6E3A505A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6684e14295ec07e506422c105ff91b44b7b504768f0c0f8da0d6e83bf3bfda73
#. default-sha256: 626167c0539efd59f8109380ae59019d4204188776aa06defb2dd1916e678bf3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7E77A93C_97B6_46DB_90A6_D4C6E3A505A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmm?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Is someone at the door?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫………? ⟪k:3⟫누가 ⟪k:4⟫온 걸까……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C11C86C8_E501_4EDE_B209_83D989A12E52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e7ffba1adabf99f890d13d21615975af1b94ea81efb726ebe4d531209434233
#. default-sha256: d60611c8eca47c1685e455b05a108ad9d35f154965bbac5eb389f333797fd070
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C11C86C8_E501_4EDE_B209_83D989A12E52"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The flow of time was hazy within the mansion’s walls. ⟪k:1⟫They had little way of telling "
"whether it was night or day, preventing them from knowing exactly how much time had passed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫캄캄한 저택에선 시간 경과도 애매했습니다. ⟪k:1⟫시간을 확인할 수단이 한정되어서 ⟪k:2⟫정확한 시"
"간을 파악할 수가 없었지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_39EB3EAB_7C0F_4D68_B10C_55ED104EAC75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29959f0e5f1bd483ce4ca5425c744a33b32ae3f5319358463e7d684c2bf090ca
#. default-sha256: 561562cab4370acde756ca733575d1f0b6a78e9b99a6c08343a2312858e54a09
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_39EB3EAB_7C0F_4D68_B10C_55ED104EAC75"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had made a habit of climbing the observation tower every so often to "
"see whether the sun was up, which allowed her to approximate the time of day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫부지런히 ⟪k:1⟫감시탑을 올라가 해가 떴는지 확인하는 일과―― 그걸 반복해야 ⟪k:2⟫가까스로 아침과 "
"밤이 구분되었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F87761B9_B58B_4448_8629_4751E9B8488E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7504280a7b7e9990a734e4fea2e2a00c7a5dc42207fa582c4084ac7cccdf0ec5
#. default-sha256: 5a8834701ebf4b7a0c77cf37c4128f030c47be896ee6c791f71afe10a7203a8f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F87761B9_B58B_4448_8629_4751E9B8488E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Consequently, when she heard the knock on the door, she was not aware just how deep the "
"night was outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that forest and beast alike lay quietly at rest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그렇기에 ⟪k:1⟫그 누군가의 방문이―― 동물과 자연마저 잠잠해지는 ⟪k:2⟫심야였단 사실을 ⟪k:3⟫소녀"
"는 미처 몰랐습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6C9B35A5_F117_40B3_A387_462780EB00E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1cc5ebbcee2b22ad7c3b015e3cdd84f1a7a39400fe5d41a79d5bb6f25e5e02fd
#. default-sha256: 72b8b9bab48f3faf8c26293b8e89d9c6dd2693b048d26f5b5ea76c809dc85c7a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6C9B35A5_F117_40B3_A387_462780EB00E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Oh, right, the stores in the cellar ⟪k:1⟫are⟪k:2⟫ almost exhausted...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(그러고 보니 ⟪k:1⟫창고 비축이 떨어져 갔지……)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F662AC6A_109C_4237_B301_A595D078DCE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eab86188397a47d7358fe15169d7384f676a55a0d834e86002613a577b407dcd
#. default-sha256: 962418b3e3a2854ef05e9fa2c109db5739b3e66334e90ae2e15d77f35d0ff3d1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F662AC6A_109C_4237_B301_A595D078DCE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It must be this month’s delivery.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(상자가 또 온 걸까)"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2FDFD391_D01D_430A_8FB5_8AD19682A08A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50a8b6acc2a439c222685e4561cdc4934726254fe12c732e7dafcdd2d19ea42b
#. default-sha256: aea336453b9337600810942e0f8e79b6f4345523d0abf20b3c0211178f6fe8ad
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2FDFD391_D01D_430A_8FB5_8AD19682A08A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not thinking it was worth bothering Michel over, she made her way out of her chambers and "
"headed for the entrance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 방에서 나와 ⟪k:1⟫현관 대문으로 갔습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫미셸을 번거롭게 하지 않으려고 ⟪k:4⟫"
"혼자서요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A66F8C4E_786F_457E_8E11_6433A05D1710
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da0f78351c98bf05397f56e1ea31779b1128b0ab5512c5e65c8207c1c46790ff
#. default-sha256: 8f2826ad933eeeb144d959a8c0bde2e36275d572016f773b4fe9d1d074a79036
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A66F8C4E_786F_457E_8E11_6433A05D1710"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There had only been a single knock,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫문을 두드리는 소리는 ⟪k:1⟫처음에만 들렸고, ⟪k:2⟫더 들리진 않았습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫소녀는 이렇게 "
"생각했을 겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BBB7D78A_4C7B_4265_83A7_52CF48469070
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2921a2020df1461f6dd387b218874d853fde44c35cdbff98d99a170cf550b8e
#. default-sha256: 89a394efeed3b15b1be304711674f4a32043e692620ad9e227cdcd575f17bd85
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BBB7D78A_4C7B_4265_83A7_52CF48469070"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫leading her to conclude that, as before, the servant had simply left the box outside the "
"door."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저번처럼 ⟪k:1⟫상자만 밖에 있겠거니."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B01D0B15_E1EE_49B9_BD57_10B0CA1C1B60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3762ee3546978ba51dae81ee86c579f1df024603904cd80fd7b8ea363768970
#. default-sha256: b0276322036deb9892de502fe6b8ad2247bcf3786096988b17143ea9ec953c6b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B01D0B15_E1EE_49B9_BD57_10B0CA1C1B60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So without a second thought, she opened the door—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그렇게 조심성 없이 문을 연 순간――, ⟪k:2⟫소녀는 ⟪k:3⟫보았습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FC468F18_DCC6_46B6_AD08_05BC3BCEDF6C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 645f2c882d47bd920d5f93dffd47a5a1a67004bdaea8b6d7484a18d08f3be88d
#. default-sha256: 33e31c6f2a9de321d08249c64ace2776fcf7e3d2a50c3a654eb1f4f69c5e3d93
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FC468F18_DCC6_46B6_AD08_05BC3BCEDF6C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and there she saw a strange, vagrant man standing in the moonlight. ⟪k:1⟫His clothes were "
"tattered, his bearded face bony and emaciated."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫달빛을 등진 ⟪k:1⟫낯선 한 남자를. ⟪k:2⟫옷이 찢어진 데다, ⟪k:3⟫초췌한 얼굴에 수염이 마구 자란 "
"⟪k:4⟫부랑자를."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8A71D3D9_E307_411B_ABF6_BB00BFBB53DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cad38864b1b498f31bb5aff1cdb9536214994e9f270f50649595e91ab77bd3ff
#. default-sha256: 1c378ce91d742daafb867a52eef13b4302e6befacb8e75fe5235b1c4e491a96a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8A71D3D9_E307_411B_ABF6_BB00BFBB53DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3595D187_60FD_4829_86D6_7B456706EDD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96f1c299da69db7aca7bb63571748557b810b5fc55c304f767482df3cb95fccf
#. default-sha256: 260ced734f6fdfb99413dca439124bd900e901310d179a07a3a241bd2dc1617b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3595D187_60FD_4829_86D6_7B456706EDD3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She gasped, shrinking back several paces. ⟪k:1⟫The heavy door began to swing shut, but the "
"man forced it open,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 놀라서 ⟪k:1⟫뒷걸음질을 쳤습니다. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 ⟪k:3⟫그 남자는 무게를 따라 자연스럽게 닫"
"히려는 문을 ⟪k:4⟫비집어 열곤……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DCDC200C_5930_4228_A84C_5A1555F94B21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 622c5c0ad6db18c835f157b2b2c70c7a7ead818512e19027bd999bee2a313c97
#. default-sha256: 9cdb4dbd16896d74c0c6e64950f5cbdbabaf84bcec15027caf95779390ed05d3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DCDC200C_5930_4228_A84C_5A1555F94B21"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫glaring down at her with unfocused eyes and mumbling,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫탁한 눈으로 소녀를 보더니, ⟪k:1⟫어눌하게 말했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_0E7B69CA_31B2_4FCD_9779_175E3F94FB67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9615600ad7a71e3567b0762a3eeb3c7daa69a89141b9ef23bcd5610b5bff5a7e
#. default-sha256: 4e03d0408fa6dfa32e3e8ee6166a8d87f42688ce63729ad468f9a01c117b6817
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0E7B69CA_31B2_4FCD_9779_175E3F94FB67"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are ye the witch that’ll grant people’s wishes?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신이 소원을 이뤄 준다는 마녀야……?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A34CF1FA_E92C_44D3_B497_C6503B98EBB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcb8be952ebda3447eb8e2754a0c574e851c7990360374f68c080081fee81869
#. default-sha256: de521aa319fc691af9fb4d1563994000bf9d9678eef977e9b0eb0ae0cd627618
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A34CF1FA_E92C_44D3_B497_C6503B98EBB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was in that moment that the White-Haired Girl realized she had been careless. ⟪k:1⟫The "
"man had sought out the mansion because he believed the legend of the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――소녀는 그제서야 ⟪k:1⟫자신의 어리석은 행동을 후회했습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 남자는 ⟪k:4⟫마녀의 전"
"승을 믿고 저택까지 온 자였습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3EA1F26B_E711_4316_A68E_172EC1760EB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb1721a2bf4a8c45143c15e84097ad25ca808f0a5e90018066023d96e3d551b5
#. default-sha256: c6f53006d9335fcefd79a75cae3d6e9fe5ee8f009801cd1d0f0b77e4b35604a8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3EA1F26B_E711_4316_A68E_172EC1760EB6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And he did not seem particularly right of mind, either—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫perhaps a result of "
"wandering through the forest for several days. Or perhaps it was ⟪k:3⟫because⟪k:4⟫ he was so "
"beaten down that he thought to ask for a witch’s help."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫며칠이나 방황한 탓인지―― 마녀에게 소원을 빌 만큼 정신이 무너진 탓인지, ⟪k:1⟫그 남자의 분위기"
"는 심상치 않았습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7257A84_1D3E_4823_A936_F17F36BE0932
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eedf924b06c7b4569c414bdf25ba2d4d2ee8c6412a16838fc6a1e428123a9e6d
#. default-sha256: b524c3777c193211a891ffe06316ea7a5bfb6784118ef23b550f85f34adb41bc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7257A84_1D3E_4823_A936_F17F36BE0932"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In a word, he seemed mad."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫한마디로 표현하자면―― 광기를 띠었지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_88F28DEE_9E99_46D5_872F_3095AA05A27B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64fb832e54803cf05bc536e7580aa66ed64624c018d25a02bc0d1b158059110a
#. default-sha256: d8ec512be4a707bca75d8e61a7996f74bd0f0c1a7546912f45da34590001e515
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_88F28DEE_9E99_46D5_872F_3095AA05A27B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There is no witch here..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아, ⟪k:1⟫아니에요…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫여기에 ⟪k:4⟫소원을 이루어 주는 마녀는 ⟪k:5⟫없어요……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1BE00853_0238_48B0_BA1C_28E0370C7C4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5578b781c901e5575d8744c7f01c901b61494467309556734095c0f3b16da85
#. default-sha256: f22dffb702eb1307333cccc6fbc5f05b834f1223c95b1b612264757721148543
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1BE00853_0238_48B0_BA1C_28E0370C7C4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sure there is. Don’t ye lie to me...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can ’ear the witch’s voice..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫말만 그렇고 있지? ⟪k:1⟫이봐, ⟪k:2⟫거짓말 마……. ⟪k:3⟫내 귀에는 들린단 말이야, ⟪k:4⟫마녀의 목소"
"리가……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_880EC7AC_1F2B_4DD7_B643_47239262DAF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bdc030d8a2c0578b38f5973e087cd2172195ecaf0a82a3e040ff0a21a1b8727
#. default-sha256: ea388b50e1fa88aea4aa3e021734c36ea01845334614e0011a59d010e277b392
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_880EC7AC_1F2B_4DD7_B643_47239262DAF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She led me to this ’ouse!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 저택으로 이끄는 여자 목소리가……!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_75400493_59A8_4243_BB66_2EE779585351
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84d06393628faef5fa49b54b6be26d9c9ba1aa269e3499c488740234b58a2908
#. default-sha256: 335f678847f6211e091db9757d2901faf606460449b6f96829a3b4d983c1cf53
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_75400493_59A8_4243_BB66_2EE779585351"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ngh... ⟪k:1⟫I-⟪k:2⟫I promise you, there isn’t!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Now please, be on your way!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫힉……, ⟪k:1⟫저, ⟪k:2⟫정말로 ⟪k:3⟫없어요! ⟪k:4⟫부탁드릴게요, ⟪k:5⟫돌아가 주세요!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0237B531_A3CD_4C65_886E_E37919AB5260
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5c8a7667418d2bb7968ebea9c3122f6bbe45b0cfa140ee6c8b4b5ac4f841271
#. default-sha256: c9d0e697d806324640baf36d63b7eb6086ba042e79b6700999ebe6a0222ae6f6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0237B531_A3CD_4C65_886E_E37919AB5260"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫’Ave ye any idea ’ow long it took to find this place?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫’Ow many days I’ve gone "
"without food or water?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And ye’re tellin’ me to get lost?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫여기까지 왔는데 돌아가라고? ⟪k:1⟫시간을 얼마나 쓴 줄 알고 그래! ⟪k:2⟫며칠이나 쫄쫄 굶으며 온 "
"줄 알고 그래……!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_099B4492_1369_4746_AD8C_8DC846C0252B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c1e5ad7e0a06d67eb3cae68f1fce834c8b1fc802e719d9babd72da4c7399125
#. default-sha256: 21c54da460171ae5499eea41021088e5333c3b551c5bfd74fa7d516bce03ae8c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_099B4492_1369_4746_AD8C_8DC846C0252B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I don’t know what you want from me...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m happy to give you a little food, "
"so please!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제, ⟪k:1⟫제게 ⟪k:2⟫그러신들……. ⟪k:3⟫식량이라면 조금 ⟪k:4⟫드릴게요. ⟪k:5⟫그러니 가 주세요……!"

